{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Search for an object, grab it and inspect it. Store it and randomly move afterward.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = SearchForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectWithinReach    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <SubTree ID = InspectObject    /> <Action ID = StoreObject    /> <Condition ID = IsAreaClear    /> <Action ID = MoveToRandomLocation    />",
